{"skill":{"slug":"cron","displayName":"Cron"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773303797509,"changelog":"Cron@1.0.0: Local-first recurring schedule engine for repeated tasks, routines, and time-based execution. Added daily/weekly/monthly/interval jobs, pause/resume controls, and next-run visibility.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1553,"sha256":"7ccfcf48758140914ad2099fb2c5b5e27ca75c7bac97ffd38d51557b63c61cc7","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/philosophy.md","size":234,"sha256":"46324e6dfb11dd4c8c0e67a0aa6f5fd363d242f66c6d61686d04c61fa8eda4ca","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/add_job.py","size":3126,"sha256":"3eb10893ac52e58d02b7d25f04abde54d03eff38d3dd5f3765944d5078d6b214","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/init_storage.py","size":1342,"sha256":"c271eccb3b252c14941f3e6f26f58d7b6da5d19c0ea466770722ae4abf93ceb1","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/lib/schedule.py","size":2249,"sha256":"3be7315bfc7a5ad5d0f4b7a72536e65d2de0dccefcd6f5b3ce7dff2aeac37134","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/lib/storage.py","size":1908,"sha256":"d18e3486271a46a239a0514abe9cfc9a0b8de0e972ba83c0585628451783da2e","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/list_jobs.py","size":471,"sha256":"e05d7b453086b35b57456335e133b76e3f780d7706a5d59a7e996e3c38cd9a17","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/next_run.py","size":707,"sha256":"067148089a2d9ffbc0eebb7d4042b3fd2af008eacba633baba44db735844fcbf","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/pause_job.py","size":874,"sha256":"725532f267fd427d77dc0ad0ef4067168bc8d082673de4605081a98822656e32","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/resume_job.py","size":1207,"sha256":"adb57305c401412aea6abf441bca4e15468d06efeac848b70bc253c97f6520b7","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"scripts/show_job.py","size":589,"sha256":"54e1e4814105204717c59e96dfcff4fd6beda0cc220e7b4908f941b6822d3518","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill.json","size":525,"sha256":"dc4d0a026f0f6effeec6fa4d224b7591dd04f9f823986f8790097ddb36cb135c","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1863,"sha256":"f76126284291e88b366756de30d51d465491112bed668691565591bdb960131a","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789161536190,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b80a02d0b416a1cb24d59f716c6b6858c4cb7c409298bf6fc0302c427be10f21","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b80a02d0b416a1cb24d59f716c6b6858c4cb7c409298bf6fc0302c427be10f21","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085946086},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":57,"severity":"HIGH","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":8,"checkedAt":1789161536190},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a local schedule tracker that writes disclosed JSON state under the OpenClaw memory directory and does not show hidden networking, privilege escalation, or destructive behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The scripts use Python standard library file I/O only, with no external packages, network calls, subprocess execution, credential access, or broad local indexing.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains markdown, JSON metadata, and Python scripts only; skill.json declares no entrypoints and no install-time execution mechanism.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The activation description is broad and says to use the skill for many scheduling-related mentions, so agents should distinguish informational timing questions from user-directed persistent schedule changes.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Persistent local writes to jobs.json, runs.json, and stats.json under ~/.openclaw/workspace/memory/cron are purpose-aligned and disclosed in SKILL.md, but users should understand schedule data is retained there.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifacts coherently implement a local recurring schedule utility with add, list, show, pause, resume, and next-run scripts for daily, weekly, monthly, and interval schedules.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you want a local schedule tracker that stores job titles, notes, tags, timing, status, and stats in your OpenClaw memory directory. Confirm before asking an agent to add, pause, or resume schedules, and specify a timezone if Asia/Tokyo is not appropriate.","findings":"[TP4] expected: The scanner concern about overstated capability is downgraded: the scripts do implement schedule storage, next-run calculation, pause, resume, show, and list workflows, though they do not independently execute jobs or provide a background runner.\n[LP3] expected: Local file-backed storage is expected for a local-first cron memory skill and the exact storage paths are disclosed; no evidence showed broader file access beyond the cron directory.\n[SQP-1] unexpected: The routing text is broad and could cause over-invocation for ordinary scheduling conversations, but the artifact does not automatically mutate state without running the explicit scripts.\n[SQP-3] unexpected: The default timezone is hardcoded to Asia/Tokyo in add_job.py, which is a usability and correctness issue rather than a security concern.\n[SQP-2] expected: The persistent JSON writes are expected for local schedule storage and are disclosed in SKILL.md; the lower-level helper lacks inline notices, but calling scripts print user-visible results after mutations.\n[aig-skill-scan] expected: The A.I.G SARIF run reported no results, consistent with inspection showing no remote payload retrieval, tool hijacking, privilege escalation, unsafe dependency, or malicious embedded code.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789161536190}}}}}